# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# NexusIntel Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# DATABASE
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite (default, development):
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./nexusintel.db

# PostgreSQL (production):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/nexusintel

# APPLICATION
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
DEBUG=false
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
ENVIRONMENT=development

# SECRET KEY (change in production)
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-change-in-production

# CORS SETTINGS
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000

# API KEYS (OPTIONAL - Leave blank to disable integrations)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
SHODAN_API_KEY=
ABUSEIPDB_API_KEY=
VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY=
CENSYS_API_KEY=
GREYNOISE_API_KEY=
OTX_API_KEY=

# FEATURES
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
ENABLE_ENRICHMENT=true
ENABLE_GRAPH_ENGINE=true
ENABLE_AUTONOMOUS_PIVOTING=false
ENABLE_CAMPAIGN_CLUSTERING=true
ENABLE_THREAT_INTEL=true

# FILE UPLOADS
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE=52428800  # 50MB
ALLOWED_UPLOAD_TYPES=jpg,jpeg,png,gif,pdf,txt,json,csv,log,zip

# RATE LIMITING
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true
RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW=60

# ENRICHMENT TIMEOUTS
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
DNS_TIMEOUT=5
WHOIS_TIMEOUT=10
HTTP_TIMEOUT=10
ENRICHMENT_MAX_WORKERS=10

# REDIS (Optional - for async tasks)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
# ENABLE_REDIS=false

# FRONTEND
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
